      "evidence": [
        {
          "id": "S8E2",
          "sourceId": "f40f9449da42b2f5",
          "quote": "They argue that suspense is composed of fear, hope, and the &ldquo;cognitive state of uncertainty&rdquo; (131)."
        },
        {
          "id": "S8E5",
          "sourceId": "f40f9449da42b2f5",
          "quote": "On the standard account, people feel suspense when they fear a bad outcome, hope for a good outcome, and are uncertain about which outcome will"
        },
        {
          "id": "S8E9",
          "sourceId": "f40f9449da42b2f5",
          "quote": "Ortony, Clore, and Collins argue that as &ldquo;prospect emotions,&rdquo; fear and hope depend on the desirability and likelihood of a prospective outcome&mdash;the yet to be"
        },
        {
          "id": "S8E11",
          "sourceId": "f40f9449da42b2f5",
          "quote": "For example, fear is amplified as the degree of danger, the undesirability and/or likelihood of an outcome, increases."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E1",
          "sourceId": "3eee501f02c99a86",
          "quote": "Even though Nobel laureate Paul Samuelson is usually credited with having introduced the theory of public goods to modern economics (e.g., in Sandmo 1989), the"
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E8",
          "sourceId": "3eee501f02c99a86",
          "quote": "In the contemporary debate, this feature or characteristic of goods is usually referred to as &ldquo;non-rivalry&rdquo;."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E9",
          "sourceId": "3eee501f02c99a86",
          "quote": "A good is rivalrous if and only if an individual&rsquo;s consumption of it diminishes others&rsquo; ability to consume it."
        },
        {
          "id": "S6E1",
          "sourceId": "11b88ec578ae50f6",
          "quote": "Federal Conservatives want the auditor general and parliamentary budget officer to investigate Ottawa's planned GlobalEye purchase, questioning whether proper procurement rules were followed."
        },
        {
          "id": "S6E2",
          "sourceId": "11b88ec578ae50f6",
          "quote": "The demand follows revelations the Saab aircraft meets only some military requirements and that competitors had not been shown those requirements before the government announced"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10E1",
          "sourceId": "2c9eff63b3dc03c7",
          "quote": "The Federal Communications Commission yesterday approved Paramount Skydance's plan to sell large equity stakes to the sovereign wealth funds of Saudi Arabia, the United Arab"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10E5",
          "sourceId": "2c9eff63b3dc03c7",
          "quote": "Paramount says its indirect foreign ownership will reach 49.5 percent after it receives investments from the sovereign wealth funds and filed a petition asking the"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10E8",
          "sourceId": "2c9eff63b3dc03c7",
          "quote": "Discovery in a $111 billion deal that is being partially financed with foreign investment but hasn't completed the acquisition because US states filed a lawsuit"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10E10",
          "sourceId": "2c9eff63b3dc03c7",
          "quote": "Trump's Department of Justice approved the merger. Read full article Comments"
