        {
          "id": "S2E1",
          "sourceId": "57c41774142bca9d",
          "quote": "Credit: NASA The Republic of Albania will sign the Artemis Accords during a ceremony at 12 p.m."
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E2",
          "sourceId": "57c41774142bca9d",
          "quote": "EDT on Monday, Sept. 21, at NASA Headquarters in Washington, becoming the 73rd country signatory."
        },
        {
          "id": "S2E3",
          "sourceId": "57c41774142bca9d",
          "quote": "NASA Deputy Administrator Matt Anderson will host Albania’s Minister for Europe and Foreign Affairs Ferit Hoxha and Ambassador of the Republic of Albania to the"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10E4",
          "sourceId": "a7fed213f5e257e0",
          "quote": "In a recent Nature study, Terral and Renata Batista-Brito, who runs the lab, report a population of cortical cells that challenges that assumption."
        },
        {
          "id": "S10E5",
          "sourceId": "a7fed213f5e257e0",
          "quote": "These cortical cells make up only around one percent of the cortex's inhibitory neurons, and switching them on in a mouse puts the"
        },
        {
          "id": "S10E7",
          "sourceId": "a7fed213f5e257e0",
          "quote": "“What our work shows is that the cortex can not only see this rhythm but also initiate it by itself, and this is sufficient to"
        },
        {
          "id": "S9E4",
          "sourceId": "0db9a3038435facf",
          "quote": "This musical era came to a violent end under the Khmer Rouge regime of the 1970s , which shuttered entertainment venues and killed nine in"
        },
        {
          "id": "S9E5",
          "sourceId": "0db9a3038435facf",
          "quote": "ten of the country’s professional musicians."
        },
        {
          "id": "S9E6",
          "sourceId": "0db9a3038435facf",
          "quote": "While “Cambodia’s popular music culture virtually ceased to exist for a twenty-year period,” it has since made a remarkable comeback."
        },
        {
          "id": "S9E10",
          "sourceId": "0db9a3038435facf",
          "quote": "While conducting fieldwork in Phnom Penh between 2004 and 2006, Mamula was struck by the “musical vitality” of the country’s soundscape and the ubiquity of"
        },
        {
          "id": "S9E11",
          "sourceId": "0db9a3038435facf",
          "quote": "the “colorful CD jewel cases” on display."
        },
        {
          "id": "S9E12",
          "sourceId": "0db9a3038435facf",
          "quote": "He found that access to technologies such as television and compact discs (CDs) “has been instrumental in regenerating indigenous culture” in Cambodia."
        },
        {
          "id": "S3E1",
          "sourceId": "07937470d39c41f6",
          "quote": "President Donald Trump says he is banning three major news outlets, CNN, MS NOW and Politico, from the White House due to what he called"
        },
        {
          "id": "S3E2",
          "sourceId": "07937470d39c41f6",
          "quote": "\"unfavorable coverage.\""
        },
        {
          "id": "S3E3",
          "sourceId": "07937470d39c41f6",
          "quote": "Trump didn't provide details on how the ban would be implemented, but warned he might bar other media outlets as well."
        }
